---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/layout/Header.astro';
import Hero from '../components/layout/Hero.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <slot name="head">
    <title>Video to Image Converter - Extract Frames from Videos Online Free</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Convert video to image online free. Extract frames from any video and save as JPG, PNG, WebP, or AVIF. No uploads, 100% client-side, unlimited conversions.">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Video to Image Converter - Extract Frames from Videos Online Free">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Convert video to image online free. Extract frames from any video and save as JPG, PNG, WebP, or AVIF. No uploads, 100% client-side, unlimited conversions.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="/logo.svg">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://freevideotoimage.com/">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Video to Image Converter - Extract Frames from Videos Online Free">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Convert video to image online free. Extract frames from any video and save as JPG, PNG, WebP, or AVIF. No uploads, 100% client-side, unlimited conversions.">
  </slot>
  <Header currentPath="/" />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <Hero
      title="Video to Image Converter"
      subtitle="Extract frames from any video. Client-side, private, free. No uploads, no limits."
      ctaText="Upload Video"
      ctaHref="/video-to-image-converter"
    />
    <section id="features" class="section bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)]" aria-labelledby="features-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-16">
          <span class="eyebrow inline-block mb-4">Features</span>
          <h2 id="features-title" class="heading-lg mb-4">Everything you need to extract frames</h2>
          <p class="body-lg">Powerful extraction modes, multiple output formats, and smart scene detection — all running in your browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Manual Frame Capture</h3>
            <p class="body-md">Scrub through your video frame-by-frame and capture exact moments with pixel-perfect precision.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Interval Extraction</h3>
            <p class="body-md">Automatically extract frames at set intervals — every second, every 5 seconds, or custom timing.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Smart Scene Detection</h3>
            <p class="body-md">AI-powered scene boundary detection extracts only the key frames when content changes.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Multiple Output Formats</h3>
            <p class="body-md">Export to PNG, JPG (70-95%), WebP (70-95%), or AVIF (50-80%) with quality presets.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">ZIP Download</h3>
            <p class="body-md">Download all frames as a convenient ZIP archive with streaming for large extractions.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">100% Client-Side</h3>
            <p class="body-md">Your videos never leave your device. All processing happens locally in your browser.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="how-it-works" class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-16">
          <span class="eyebrow inline-block mb-4">How it Works</span>
          <h2 id="how-title" class="heading-lg mb-4">Three steps to your frames</h2>
          <p class="body-lg">Simple workflow, powerful results.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mx-auto">
          <li class="card relative">
            <span class="absolute -top-4 left-6 bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-white text-3xl font-bold w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
            <div class="pt-8">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Upload Your Video</h3>
              <p class="body-md">Drag and drop or select a video file (up to 2GB). Supports MP4, WebM, MOV, and more.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card relative">
            <span class="absolute -top-4 left-6 bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-white text-3xl font-bold w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
            <div class="pt-8">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Choose Extraction Mode</h3>
              <p class="body-md">Pick manual capture, interval extraction, or smart scene detection. Adjust quality and format.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card relative">
            <span class="absolute -top-4 left-6 bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-white text-3xl font-bold w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
            <div class="pt-8">
              <h3 class="heading-md mb-3">Download Frames</h3>
              <p class="body-md">Preview extracted frames, select favorites, and download individually or as a ZIP archive.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="faq" class="section bg-[var(--color-canvas-elevated)]" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <span class="eyebrow inline-block mb-4">FAQ</span>
          <h2 id="faq-title" class="heading-lg mb-4">Common Questions</h2>
        </div>
        <dl class="space-y-4">
          <div class="card">
            <dt class="heading-md mb-2">Is there a file size limit?</dt>
            <dd class="body-md">Warning at 500MB, hard limit at 2GB. Larger videos may take longer to process.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <dt class="heading-md mb-2">What video formats are supported?</dt>
            <dd class="body-md">MP4, WebM, MOV, AVI, MKV, and most formats playable in your browser.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <dt class="heading-md mb-2">Does this upload my video to a server?</dt>
            <dd class="body-md">No. All processing happens entirely in your browser. Your video never leaves your device.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <dt class="heading-md mb-2">What output formats are available?</dt>
            <dd class="body-md">PNG (lossless), JPG (70-95% quality), WebP (70-95% quality), AVIF (50-80% quality, Safari 16.4+).</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <dt class="heading-md mb-2">Can I extract frames from a specific time range?</dt>
            <dd class="body-md">Yes, you can set start and end times for extraction in all modes.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="seo-content" class="section bg-[var(--color-canvas)]">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mx-auto mb-16">
          <span class="eyebrow inline-block mb-4">About Video to Image Converter</span>
          <h2 class="text-heading-lg font-semibold mb-4">Everything You Need to Know About Converting Video to Images</h2>
          <p class="body-lg max-w-[800px] mx-auto">Discover how our free online tool allows you to extract frames from any video without uploading your files, ensuring complete privacy and unlimited conversions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-8 text-lg">
          <p>In today's digital age, the ability to <strong>convert video to image</strong> has become essential for content creators, designers, and everyday users. Whether you're looking to create a <strong>video to JPG converter</strong> workflow for social media thumbnails or need to extract specific frames from a tutorial video, our tool provides a seamless, client-side solution that processes everything directly in your browser.</p>
          <p>Unlike traditional online converters that require uploading your sensitive video files to third-party servers, our <strong>video to image converter online</strong> operates entirely within your browser. This means your videos never leave your device, guaranteeing 100% privacy and security. You can freely convert video to image online free without worrying about data breaches or unauthorized access to your content.</p>
          <p>Our platform supports multiple extraction methods to suit different needs. For precise control, the manual frame capture feature lets you scrub through your video frame-by-frame and capture exact moments with pixel-perfect accuracy. This is particularly useful when you need to extract a specific frame from a video for use as a thumbnail, meme, or reference image.</p>
          <p>If you're working with longer videos and need to sample frames at regular intervals, our interval extraction tool functions as an efficient <strong>video frame extractor</strong>. You can set the tool to extract frames every second, every 5 seconds, or at custom intervals, making it ideal for creating storyboards or analyzing video content over time.</p>
          <p>For users who want intelligent automation, our smart scene detection feature uses advanced algorithms to identify significant changes in video content and extract only the key frames. This ensures you get the most representative images from your video without redundant or similar frames, saving you time and storage space.</p>
          <p>When it comes to output formats, our <strong>video to PNG converter</strong> and <strong>video to JPG converter</strong> options provide flexibility for different use cases. Choose PNG for lossless quality when you need the highest fidelity, or select JPG with adjustable quality settings (70-95%) for smaller file sizes suitable for web use. We also support modern formats like WebP and AVIF for superior compression without sacrificing quality.</p>
          <p>One of the most common use cases for our tool is creating a <strong>video screenshot</strong> collection. Whether you're capturing memorable moments from a family video, extracting frames from a gameplay recording, or saving specific moments from an educational video, our intuitive interface makes the process simple and efficient.</p>
          <p>For users who need to extract frames in a sequence for animation or video editing purposes, our tool excels as a <strong>video to image sequence</strong> generator. You can extract all frames from a video segment and download them as a numbered sequence, perfect for importing into video editing software or creating flipbook animations.</p>
          <p>We understand that users often search for a <strong>video to photo converter</strong> when they want to save a specific moment as a still image. Our tool handles this use case perfectly, allowing you to pause at any point in your video and capture that exact frame as a high-quality image file.</p>
          <p>All processing happens locally using advanced JavaScript and web APIs, meaning there are no file size limitations beyond what your browser can handle. While we provide warnings for very large files (over 500MB) and a hard limit of 2GB to prevent browser crashes, most users can process their videos without any issues.</p>
          <p>Experience the convenience of a truly free <strong>video to image converter online free</strong> with no hidden costs, no watermarks, and no registration required. Simply upload your video, choose your extraction method and output format, and download your frames instantly. Whether you're a professional content creator or someone who just wants to save a funny moment from a video, our tool provides the reliable, private, and efficient solution you need.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="cta-title">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <h2 id="cta-title" class="heading-lg mb-4">Ready to extract frames?</h2>
        <p class="body-lg mb-8 mx-auto">Upload a video and start converting in seconds. No registration, no watermarks, no limits.</p>
        <a href="/video-to-image-converter" class="btn-primary inline-flex">
          Start Converting
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>